<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: ICC Bank says H1 pretax profit up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>ICC Bank says H1 pretax profit up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months April 30, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		38.1		 vs 33.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.0		  vs 6.0</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    7.0		  vs 5.85</p>
<p> Gross income	     53.5		 vs 48.4</p>
<p>NOTE - State-owned ICC Bank is a specialist bank serving smaller businesses.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
